WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:01.749
Hi there!

2
00:00:01.889 --> 00:00:03.010
[s@Hi there!

3
00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:03.710
Who are you?

4
00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.552
I'm an American bison.

5
00:00:06.592 --> 00:00:10.335
We're very big land mammals.

6
00:00:10.375 --> 00:00:13.877
Where do you live?

7
00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:34.402
American bison live in North America.

8
00:00:36.003 --> 00:00:37.684
We like grasslands.

9
00:00:40.405 --> 00:00:41.886
You look really heavy!

10
00:00:43.747 --> 00:00:46.408
Yes, but we can run fast.

11
00:00:48.309 --> 00:00:50.891
We can also swim and jump high.

12
00:00:53.132 --> 00:00:55.533
You have a big hump on your back.

13
00:00:57.034 --> 00:00:59.916
Yes. We have very strong backs.

14
00:01:01.664 --> 00:01:04.105
That helps us move our heavy heads.

15
00:01:07.566 --> 00:01:08.727
What do you eat?

16
00:01:10.548 --> 00:01:13.909
American bison eat lots and lots of grass.

17
00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:18.151
We also like leaves and weeds.

18
00:01:19.871 --> 00:01:22.032
We eat all day long!

19
00:01:25.374 --> 00:01:26.634
Who do you live with?

20
00:01:28.595 --> 00:01:31.036
I live with a small group of bison.

21
00:01:32.424 --> 00:01:34.425
Sometimes we join a big herd.

22
00:01:38.868 --> 00:01:40.590
Do you have any enemies?

23
00:01:42.411 --> 00:01:45.072
We're usually safe because we're big.

24
00:01:46.794 --> 00:01:50.436
Sometimes bears, wolves, or mountain lions hunt us.

25
00:01:52.097 --> 00:01:53.398
People hunt us too.

26
00:01:57.941 --> 00:01:58.621
I'm hungry.

27
00:01:59.802 --> 00:02:01.023
I'll see you later.

28
00:02:03.373 --> 00:02:05.105
Good-bye, American Bison!
